  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "primo-video-media",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPRIMO Video Media\n\t\n\nThis repository stores split ZIP archives for primo-video media assets (videos + pre-extracted frames).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPackaging\n\t\n\n\nSplit format: zip multi-part (.z01, .z02, ..., .zip)\nPart size target: ~5GB (configured during packaging)\nIntegrity files:\nmanifest.csv\nSHA256SUMS.txt\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tQuick Verify\n\t\n\nsha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tReconstruct & Extract\n\t\n\nFor each source archive group, keep all parts in one folder, then run:\n# Example for one archive base\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/LeonOverload/primo-video-media.",
